IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bsg-corporation`

-- Brothers of St. Gabriel Ordinance 1950, ss 2-6 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_brothers-of-st-gabriel-ordinance-1950.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a deed sealed before and signed by the Titular Superior` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Titular Superior`
    `signed by` IS `the Titular Superior`

`a deed sealed before and signed by the Brother Procurator` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Brother Procurator`
    `signed by` IS `the Brother Procurator`

`a deed sealed before and signed by a deposited attorney` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `an attorney under a deposited power of attorney`
    `signed by` IS `an attorney under a deposited power of attorney`

`a deed signed by an attorney whose power was not deposited` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Titular Superior`
    `signed by` IS `an attorney whose power of attorney is not deposited`

`an unsealed deed signed by the Titular Superior` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS FALSE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Titular Superior`
    `signed by` IS `the Titular Superior`

`a deed sealed before another Brother and signed by the Titular Superior` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `another Brother`
    `signed by` IS `the Titular Superior`

`a deed sealed before the Brother Procurator and signed by a deposited attorney` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Brother Procurator`
    `signed by` IS `an attorney under a deposited power of attorney`

§ `s 2(3) -- vacancy and the Brother Procurator`

#ASSERT NOT `the office is vacant` `the office is filled`
#ASSERT `the office is vacant` `vacant by resignation`
#ASSERT `the office is vacant` `vacant by death`
#ASSERT `the office is vacant` `vacant for some other reason`

#ASSERT `the Brother Procurator is deemed a successor in office` `vacant by resignation` FALSE
#ASSERT `the Brother Procurator is deemed a successor in office` `vacant by death` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the Brother Procurator is deemed a successor in office` `vacant for some other reason` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the Brother Procurator is deemed a successor in office` `the office is filled` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the Brother Procurator is deemed a successor in office` `vacant by resignation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Brother Procurator is deemed a successor in office` `vacant by death` TRUE

